{"sha": "1ab6d92dded6e6b4362037841c8be9feeb33b586cc4deb577bc95c38f1e9d004", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:integration:9}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 在 $\\intoo{0}{\\pi}$ 上：$x > 0$，$a - bx = b(\\frac ab - x) =", "        b(\\pi - x) > 0$，$\\sin x > 0$，故被积函数 $> 0$，", "        从而 $I_n > 0$（严格正性）。估计：在", "        $\\intcc{0}{\\pi}$ 上，$x \\leq \\pi$，$a - bx \\leq a$，故 $P", "        \\leq \\frac{\\pi^n a^n}{n!}$，且 $I_n \\leq", "        \\pi\\,\\frac{(\\pi a)^n}{n!}$，它趋于 $0$（阶乘", "        增长快于几何项：它是", "        收敛指数级数的通项，参见", "        \\cref{ex:b1:seq:e}）；特别地，$I_n < 1$ 对充分大的 $n$ 成立。", "  \\item 展开 $x^n(a - bx)^n = \\sum_{j=0}^{n} \\binom nj a^{n-j}", "        (-b)^j x^{n+j}$，故 $P = \\frac{1}{n!}\\sum_j c_j x^{n+j}$，", "        其中 $c_j$ 为整数。于是 $P^{(k)}(0) = 0$，当 $k < n$ 时", "        （由零点阶数），且对 $n \\leq k \\leq 2n$，$P^{(k)}(0) =", "        \\frac{k!}{n!} c_{k-n}$，它是整数，因为 $n! \\mid k!$。", "        此外 $P(\\pi - x) = P(x)$（代入：$\\pi - x$ 交换两个因子，", "        利用 $a - b(\\pi - x) = bx$），故 $P^{(k)}(\\pi)", "        = \\pm P^{(k)}(0)$，同样为整数。", "  \\item 令 $Q = P - P'' + P^{(4)} - \\dots$（有限和，$P$ 的次数为", "        $2n$）：$Q + Q'' = P$，且", "        \\[", "        \\bigl(Q'\\sin x - Q\\cos x\\bigr)' = (Q + Q'')\\sin x = P\\sin x .", "        \\]", "        于是 $I_n = \\bigl[Q'\\sin x - Q\\cos x\\bigr]_0^{\\pi} = Q(\\pi)", "        + Q(0)$，它是若干 $P^{(2k)}$ 在 $0$ 与 $\\pi$ 处的值之和，", "        由 (2) 知其为整数。", "  \\item 当 $n$ 充分大时，$I_n$ 为整数，且 $0 < I_n < 1$：", "        矛盾。假设 $\\pi = \\frac ab$ 不成立，故 $\\pi$ 是", "        无理数。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:integration:10}", "$C^1$ 情形：分部积分，", "\\[", "\\int_a^b f(t)\\sin\\lambda t\\,\\dd t", "= \\Bigl[-f(t)\\frac{\\cos\\lambda t}{\\lambda}\\Bigr]_a^b", "+ \\frac{1}{\\lambda}\\int_a^b f'(t)\\cos\\lambda t\\,\\dd t,", "\\]", "其绝对值不超过 $\\frac{2\\sup\\abs f + (b - a)\\sup\\abs{f'}}", "{\\lambda} \\to 0$.", "", "连续情形：取 $\\varepsilon > 0$，并取一个阶梯函数", "$\\varphi$，使得 $\\abs{f - \\varphi} \\leq \\varepsilon$", "（由\\cref{thm:b1:integration:approx}可知存在 $\\varphi \\leq f \\leq", "\\psi$，且间隙 $\\leq\\varepsilon$；取 $\\varphi$）。于是", "\\[", "\\Bigl|\\int_a^b f\\sin\\lambda t\\Bigr|", "\\leq \\int_a^b \\abs{f - \\varphi}", "+ \\Bigl|\\int_a^b \\varphi \\sin\\lambda t\\Bigr|", "\\leq (b-a)\\varepsilon", "+ \\sum_i \\abs{c_i}\\,\\Bigl|\\int_{x_{i-1}}^{x_i} \\sin\\lambda t\\,\\dd", "t\\Bigr| ,", "\\]", "且每个 $\\bigl|\\int \\sin \\lambda t\\bigr| = \\bigl|\\frac{\\cos\\lambda", "x_{i-1} - \\cos\\lambda x_i}{\\lambda}\\bigr| \\leq \\frac{2}{\\lambda}$:", "第二项趋于 $0$。于是上极限 $\\leq", "(b-a)\\varepsilon$（对每个 $\\varepsilon$ 成立），故极限为 $0$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:integration:11}", "设 $m = \\min f$ 与 $M = \\max f$，它们由", "最值定理取到。由于 $g \\geq 0$，有 $m\\,g \\leq fg \\leq M\\,g$，于是由", "单调性得", "\\[", "m \\int_a^b g \\;\\leq\\; \\int_a^b fg \\;\\leq\\; M \\int_a^b g .", "\\]", "若 $\\int_a^b g = 0$，则由严格正性", "（\\cref{thm:b1:integration:props}~(4)）推出 $g \\equiv 0$，两侧", "均为零，任意 $c$ 皆可。否则 $t = \\frac{\\int", "fg}{\\int g}$ 落在 $\\intcc{m}{M} = f(\\intcc{a}{b})$", "由\\cref{thm:b1:continuity:evt,thm:b1:continuity:ivt}可知，故 $t =", "f(c)$，即存在某个 $c$。", "", "符号至关重要：在 $\\intcc{-1}{1}$ 上取 $f(t) = g(t) = t$，则 $\\int", "fg = \\int_{-1}^1 t^2 = \\frac23$，而 $f(c)\\int_{-1}^1 t\\,\\dd t", "= 0$，对每个 $c$ 都成立。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:integration:12}", "若 $f \\equiv 0$，则结论平凡成立（每一点都是零点）。故", "设 $f \\not\\equiv 0$，并假设它至多有 $n$ 个不同", "零点，位于 $\\intoo{a}{b}$ 内；记 $z_1 < \\dots < z_m$（$m \\leq n$）为", "这些使 $f$ \\emph{变号}的零点（可能一个也没有）。令", "$P(t) = \\prod_{i=1}^{m}(t - z_i)$（空积 $= 1$），其次数为", "$m \\leq n$。在由各 $z_i$ 分出的每个子区间上，", "$f$ 与 $P$ 均保持定号，且跨过", "某个 $z_i$ 时两者都变号：乘积 $fP$ 在整个", "$\\intoo{a}{b}$ 上定号。由于连续、不恒为零，", "故 $\\bigl|\\int_a^b fP\\bigr| > 0$（严格", "正性用于 $\\abs{fP}$）。但 $\\int f P$ 是", "关于矩 $\\int f\\,t^k$（$k \\leq n$）的线性组合，而这些矩全为零：", "矛盾。因此 $f$ 至少有 $n + 1$ 个不同零点，位于", "$\\intoo{a}{b}$ 内。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:integration:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 设 $N = \\lceil 2c \\rceil$。当 $n \\geq N$ 时：", "$\\frac{c^{n+1}/(n+1)!}{c^n/n!} = \\frac{c}{n+1} \\leq \\frac12$，故", "$0 < \\frac{c^n}{n!} \\leq \\frac{c^N}{N!}\\,2^{-(n - N)} \\to 0$:", "夹逼。", "", "\\textbf{2.} 固定 $k$，对 $m$ 作归纳。当 $m = 0$ 时：$\\int_0^1", "x^k = \\frac{1}{k+1} = \\frac{k!\\,0!}{(k+1)!}$。归纳步，分部积分", "($u = (1-x)^m$, $v' = x^k$):", "\\[", "\\int_0^1 x^k (1-x)^m \\dd x", "= \\Bigl[\\frac{x^{k+1}}{k+1}(1-x)^m\\Bigr]_0^1", "+ \\frac{m}{k+1}\\int_0^1 x^{k+1}(1-x)^{m-1}\\dd x", "= \\frac{m}{k+1}\\cdot\\frac{(k+1)!\\,(m-1)!}{(k+m+1)!} ,", "\\]", "即 $\\frac{k!\\,m!}{(k+m+1)!}$。", ""]}